  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Please give us options to offload resources to different GPUs. I don't know if any of this is possible. But perhaps split up VRAM ussage across connected GPUs. Like world assets go on one, avatars on another. Or anything at all to help spread the work load. \n\nAs we all upgrade our PCs, we'll have a old GPU sitting around doing nothing, wouldn't it be nice to have it back in a lower tier pci slot to do other tasks? Windows 11 lets us define which whole applications can run on different GPUs.\n\nPlease have a look into this, and see if there is something that a person with two GPUs can do to help optimize VRChat.",
